# Wrangler of the Damned: "At the beginning of your end step, if you haven't cast a spell from your hand this turn, create a 2/2 white
# Spirit creature token with flying" (CR 603.4, 513.1). Turn 3: Bot1 casts the Wrangler from hand, so no Spirit at its end step. Turn 4
# (Bot2's end step, "your" end step only): none. Turn 5: Bot1 casts only Faithless Looting from its graveyard (flashback is not a cast
# from hand): a Spirit at its end step. Turn 7: Bot1 casts a Mox Jet from hand, so none. The Wrangler and five Moxen are 6 permanents,
# the one Spirit makes 7, and the Mox Jet makes 8.

